<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan United Micro 1996 profit tumbles.</title>
<headline>Taiwan United Micro 1996 profit tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     22,606  vs   24,247</p>
<p>    Net profit			    7,647  vs   13,441</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (single T$)   2.71  vs    10.01</p>
<p>Note - United Microelectronics Corp is Taiwan's second largest semiconductor maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
